---
import T from './T.astro';
import ArrowUpRight from './ArrowUpRight.astro';
const games=[
 {slug:'orbit-ribbon',name:'Orbit Ribbon',kind:'orbit',tag:'01 / 3D RUN & JUMP',ja:'自動で前進する、星の道。',en:'An endless-looking road. A reachable finish.',copyJa:'固定カメラの3Dラン。左右に柱をよけ、切れ目でジャンプ。3つの軌道を最後まで駆け抜けよう。',copyEn:'A fixed-camera 3D run with automatic forward movement. Steer around pillars and jump the gaps to finish three short courses.',stagesJa:'01 はじめの軌道 → 02 すれ違う光 → 03 星をつなぐ道',stagesEn:'01 First Orbit → 02 Crossing Lights → 03 Starbound Path'},
 {slug:'amber-step',name:'Amber Step',kind:'amber',tag:'02 / 2.5D PLATFORMER',ja:'一歩ずつ、琥珀色の空へ。',en:'Little jumps across a warm, open sky.',copyJa:'横から見る3Dアクション。左右に移動し、足場やトゲをジャンプで越えてゴールへ。3つの庭を、自分のペースで。',copyEn:'3D scenery with side-view movement. Move left or right and jump across gaps, steps and spikes. Reach the finish in three stages at your own pace.',stagesJa:'01 小さな一歩 → 02 空中の階段 → 03 琥珀の庭',stagesEn:'01 A Small Step → 02 Sky Steps → 03 Amber Garden'},
 {slug:'pulse-drift',name:'Pulse Drift',kind:'pulse',tag:'03 / AUTO-FIRE SHOOTER',ja:'信号の先へ、弾をよけて。',en:'Follow the signal. Find your opening.',copyJa:'ドラッグで自機を動かす3Dシューティング。射撃は自動。赤い弾と予告線を避け、3面の中枢ボスを撃破しよう。',copyEn:'Drag your ship in a 3D auto-fire shooter. Dodge red bullets and amber warning lanes, then defeat the core boss in stage 3.',stagesJa:'01 夜明けの回廊 → 02 交差する信号 → 03 脈動の中枢',stagesEn:'01 Dawn corridor → 02 Crossed signals → 03 Pulse core'},
 {slug:'tilttrail',name:'TiltTrail',kind:'tilt',tag:'04 / 3D ROLL & BRAKE',ja:'慣性をつかんで、空の道へ。',en:'Catch the momentum. Stay on the trail.',copyJa:'左右でボールを転がし、曲がる前にブレーキ。空に浮かぶ6つの道を、縁から落ちずにゴールまで。',copyEn:'Steer a rolling ball and brake before bends. Follow six floating trails to the gate while keeping clear of the edges.',stagesJa:'01 はじめの曲がり道 → 02 波の回廊 → 03 空の尾根 → 04 息つぎのカーブ → 05 ふたつの頂点 → 06 細道の入口',stagesEn:'01 First bends → 02 Wave corridor → 03 Sky ridge → 04 Breathing bends → 05 Double apex → 06 Narrow passages'}
];
---
<div class="arcade">
<section class="container shelf" aria-labelledby="games-title" id="games">
 <div class="shelf-heading"><h1 id="games-title"><T ja="ゲーム" en="Games"/></h1><p><T ja="4つのオリジナルゲーム" en="4 original games"/></p></div>
 <div class="game-grid">{games.map(g=><article class={`game-card ${g.kind}`}>
  <a class="preview" href={`/games/${g.slug}/`} aria-label={g.name}><img src={`/games/covers/${g.slug}.png`} width="1200" height="720" loading="eager" alt={`${g.name} — composed cover using the game’s models`} data-alt-ja={`${g.name} — ゲームのモデルで構成した紹介画像`} data-alt-en={`${g.name} — composed cover using the game’s models`}/><img class="cover-title" src={`/games/covers/titles/${g.slug}.svg`} width="220" height="125" alt="" aria-hidden="true"/></a>
  <div class="card-caption"><h2><a href={`/games/${g.slug}/`}>{g.name}</a></h2><a class="play-link" href={`/games/${g.slug}/`}><T ja="遊ぶ" en="Play"/><ArrowUpRight/><span class="sr-only"> {g.name}</span></a></div>
 </article>)}</div>
 <div class="shelf-note"><p><T ja="スマホでも、キーボードでも。ダウンロード・アカウント不要。" en="Touch or keyboard. No download. No account."/></p><a href="#portal-help"><T ja="遊び方・対応環境" en="Controls & devices"/><ArrowUpRight/></a></div>
</section>
<details class="container portal-help" id="portal-help"><summary><T ja="遊び方と対応環境について" en="Controls, devices and saved progress"/></summary>
<section class="container play-guide" id="how-to-play"><div><p class="kicker"><T ja="遊び方" en="HOW TO PLAY"/></p><h2><T ja="よけて、跳んで、転がして。" en="Move. Dodge. Roll. Try again."/></h2><p><T ja="Orbit Ribbon・Amber Step・Pulse Driftは3ステージ。Orbit/Amberはクリアすると次が開きます。Pulse Driftはすべて選択可。TiltTrailは6コースで、最初の3つは選択可。4〜6は前のコースをクリアすると開きます。" en="Orbit Ribbon, Amber Step and Pulse Drift have three stages. Orbit/Amber unlock the next after a clear; Pulse Drift starts fully open. TiltTrail has six courses: the original three are open, and courses 4–6 unlock after clearing the previous course."/></p></div><div class="guide-grid"><article><b>01 / TOUCH</b><h3><T ja="両手で、リズムよく" en="Two hands, one good jump"/></h3><p><T ja="Orbit/Amberは左右＋JUMP。Pulse Driftはドラッグで移動し、自動射撃。TiltTrailは左右＋ブレーキ。同時押しに対応しています。" en="Orbit/Amber use arrows + JUMP. Drag in Pulse Drift; shooting is automatic. TiltTrail uses arrows + BRAKE. Movement and action buttons can be held together."/></p></article><article><b>02 / KEYBOARD</b><h3><T ja="キーボードでも" en="A keyboard works too"/></h3><p><T ja="Orbit/Amberは矢印/A,D＋Spaceでジャンプ。Pulse Driftは矢印/WASDで移動。TiltTrailは矢印/A,D＋Spaceで減速。各ゲームの遊び方をご確認ください。" en="Orbit/Amber: arrows or A,D + Space to jump. Pulse Drift: arrows or WASD. TiltTrail: arrows or A,D + Space to brake. Check each game’s controls before starting."/></p></article><article><b>03 / YOUR PACE</b><h3><T ja="ひと休みも、何度でも" en="Take a break. Take another try."/></h3><p><T ja="一時停止から同じ場所で再開できます。画面から離れると自動で一時停止。音は最初はOFF、いつでも切り替えられます。" en="Pause and resume from the same place. Switching away pauses play automatically. Sound starts off and can be toggled at any time."/></p></article></div></section>
<section class="container practical"><article><h2><T ja="記録は、このブラウザに" en="Your progress stays here"/></h2><p><T ja="開放したステージ・自己ベスト・音設定は、このブラウザに保存されます。アカウント同期や公開ランキングはありません。別の端末やブラウザには引き継がれません。" en="Unlocked stages, personal bests and sound settings are saved in this browser. There are no accounts, cloud sync or public leaderboards. Progress does not transfer to another browser or device."/></p><p><T ja="サイトデータの消去・プライベートブラウズ等で記録が失われる場合があります。保存が使えないときも、その画面では遊べます。Orbit/Amberのリセットはその2作品の記録だけを消去し、新作の記録は保持します。" en="Clearing site data or using private browsing can remove progress. You can still play when storage is unavailable. The Orbit/Amber reset clears those two games only and preserves the new games’ records."/></p></article><article><h2><T ja="対応環境と困ったとき" en="Devices and troubleshooting"/></h2><p><T ja="WebGL 2対応のブラウザとJavaScriptが必要です。タッチ画面・キーボード、縦・横画面に対応しています。描画の滑らかさは端末とブラウザで異なります。" en="You need JavaScript and a browser that supports WebGL 2. Touch, keyboard, portrait and landscape layouts are supported. Rendering performance varies by device and browser."/></p><p><T ja="3D描画が中断されたときは、表示された再読み込みボタンを使ってください。保存済みの記録は保持されますが、その途中のプレイは再開できません。" en="If 3D rendering stops, use the reload button shown in the game. Saved progress is kept, but the interrupted run cannot resume."/></p><a href="/contact/?type=site"><T ja="不具合を報告する →" en="Report a problem →"/></a></article></section>
</details>
</div>
<script>document.querySelector('.shelf-note a')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const help=document.querySelector<HTMLDetailsElement>('#portal-help');if(help)help.open=true;});</script>
<style>
.preview .cover-title {
  position: absolute;
  top: 8%;
  left: 10%;
  width: 48%;
  height: auto;
  object-fit: contain;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.amber .preview .cover-title { top: 7%; left: 7%; width: 51%; }
.pulse .preview .cover-title { top: 8%; left: 9%; width: 48%; }
.tilt .preview .cover-title { top: 8%; left: 11%; width: 46%; }

.shelf {
  padding-top: 12px;
}
.shelf-heading {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 13px;
}
.shelf-heading h1 {
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 750;
  line-height: 1.3;
  margin: 0;
}
.shelf-heading p {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: #a8adb9;
  margin: 0;
}
.game-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 18px;
}
.game-card {
  min-width: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: #242630;
  box-shadow: 0 7px 18px #06091126;
  transition: transform 0.18s;
}
.game-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-3px);
}
.preview {
  position: relative;
  display: block;
  aspect-ratio: 5/3;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #283347;
}
.preview img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
}
.card-caption {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  min-height: 54px;
  padding: 6px 14px;
}
.card-caption h2 {
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 850;
  letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  line-height: 1.2;
  margin: 0;
}
.orbit .card-caption h2 {
  font-style: italic;
}
.amber .card-caption h2 {
  color: #ffe1aa;
}
.pulse .card-caption h2 {
  letter-spacing: -0.05em;
}
.tilt .card-caption h2 {
  color: #bce6cc;
}
.play-link {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  min-height: 42px;
  padding: 7px 13px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 750;
  background: #b6f1da;
  color: #152725;
}
.play-link:hover {
  text-decoration: none;
  background: #d1fbe9;
}
.shelf-note {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 19px;
  color: #b6bac6;
  font-size: 12px;
}
.shelf-note p {
  margin: 0;
}
.shelf-note a {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  min-height: 38px;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.portal-help {
  margin-top: 16px;
  border-top: 1px solid #343744;
  padding-top: 13px;
}
.portal-help summary {
  font-size: 13px;
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 10px 0;
  min-height: 44px;
  color: #c3c8d5;
}
.play-guide {
  padding-top: 20px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.5fr;
  gap: 40px;
}
.play-guide.container,
.practical.container {
  width: 100%;
}
.play-guide h2 {
  font-size: 24px;
  line-height: 1.35;
  margin: 10px 0;
}
.play-guide p,
.practical p {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #aeb5c3;
}
.guide-grid {
  display: grid;
  gap: 18px;
}
.guide-grid article {
  border-top: 1px solid #343744;
  padding-top: 12px;
}
.guide-grid b {
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: #b6f1da;
}
.guide-grid h3 {
  font-size: 17px;
  margin: 6px 0;
}
.guide-grid p {
  margin: 0;
}
.practical {
  margin-top: 25px;
  border-top: 1px solid #343744;
  padding-top: 20px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 40px;
}
.practical h2 {
  font-size: 20px;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.practical a {
  font-size: 12px;
  text-decoration: underline;
}
.sr-only {
  position: absolute;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  padding: 0;
  margin: -1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
  white-space: nowrap;
  border: 0;
}
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .shelf {
    padding-top: 10px;
  }
  .shelf-heading {
    margin-bottom: 11px;
  }
  .shelf-heading h1 {
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .shelf-heading p {
    font-size: 10px;
  }
  .game-grid {
    gap: 12px 10px;
  }
  .game-card {
    border-radius: 10px;
  }
  .preview {
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
  }
  .preview img {
    object-position: 50% 50%;
  }
  .card-caption {
    min-height: 50px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .card-caption h2 {
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }
  .play-link {
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 6px;
    gap: 5px;
    font-size: 10px;
  }
  .play-link :global(.arrow-icon) {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
  }
  .shelf-note {
    font-size: 10px;
    align-items: start;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }
  .shelf-note a {
    min-height: 32px;
  }
  .portal-help {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .play-guide {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 22px;
  }
  .practical {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .shelf-note p {
    max-width: 100%;
  }
}
@media (max-width: 350px) {
  .card-caption {
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding: 5px 7px;
  }
  .card-caption h2 {
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .preview {
    aspect-ratio: 8/7;
  }
  .play-link {
    font-size: 9px;
    padding: 5px;
    min-height: 42px;
  }
  .play-link :global(.arrow-icon) {
    display: none;
  }
  .game-grid {
    gap: 10px 8px;
  }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .game-card {
    transition: none;
  }
  .game-card:hover {
    transform: none;
  }
}
</style>

